package export

// FailedEnText is the English text template for an export that could not be produced.
//
// [Ja] FailedEnText は生成できなかったエクスポートの英語テキストテンプレート
templ FailedEnText(data Data) {
	Your export could not be produced.

Nothing has changed in your space. You can start the export again from the page below.

{ data.URL }

Wikino
{ data.AppURL }
}
